                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} dom\,:\,FinSet^2\to FinSet\, ,\, (X\to Y)\mapsto X
                the domain projection functor, and
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
